abel but on the requisition is labeled  final inferior lateral   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm irregular portion of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch on the final margin  This margin is marked with black ink  On sectioning  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm firm  tan focus at the edge opposite the final margin  which is marked with the stitch  The remainder of the tissue consists mainly of fibrous tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm irregular portion of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch denoting the final margin  This margin is marked with black ink  On sectioning  the tissue consists mainly of adipose tissue with a small amount of intervening soft  white fibrous tissue  The specimen is quadrisected and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast additional lateral   are two irregular portions of fibroadipose tissue each measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  One of the portions has an attached stitch which denotes the final margin  The surface is marked with black ink  On sectioning  each portion consists mainly of firm  tan tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Portion with attached suture   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional fragment which is not oriented  Gross Dictation by Tim Robinson  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Tim Robinson  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Melinda J Lerwill M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Melinda J Lerwill M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXC