a extends to within 2 4cm of the posterior margin and 3 0cm of the anterior margin  The remainder of the cut surface consists of lobulated tan yellow fat with interspersed areas of nodular  dense gray white fibrous tissue  The lateral aspect of the specimen is palpated  no lymph nodes are identified  Also received within the container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm irregular portion of lobulated tan yellow fibroadipose tissue which is unoriented  The second portion of tissue is entirely inked black and sectioned to reveal a lobulated tan yellow fatty cut surface with no masses or lesions grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the lower outer quadrant biopsy cavity surrounding fibrous tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of tissue between the cavity and the second indurated area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the indurated area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue away from the biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the separately received portion of tissue  Received fresh  labeled  right breast skin   are 2 irregular portions of gray white skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  No masses or lesions are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART B  Breast  Right Breast   Excision PART D  Skin  , Present.
